# The screw attack's sound comes back after an energy drop's, when Samus is
# still spin-jumping (pose $02) with the screw attack (items bit 2).
# tick 60: screw attack ($03). tick 90: small energy drop ($0E), which
# remembers the screw attack and resumes it at its timer's 1. tick 150:
# large energy drop ($17), the same again. tick 200: the pose goes to $00
# and tick 210 takes a small drop, which then does not resume. Five seconds.
[songRequest=04 samusPose=02 samusItems=04]
